e first and right now  only thing they have on premiere access  and if mulan did well they're definitely  going to consider putting black widow on  premiere access as well  and disney's ceo basically already said  that he said that mulan  is going to be a test and if it goes  well they will consider doing other  movies the same way on premiere access  so hopefully we find out more  information on whether or not black  widow is leaning more towards video on  demand or it's still planning on  releasing in theaters because  unfortunately  it doesn't look like these big huge  movies are going to be going back to  theaters pretty soon regal cinema shut  down and yesterday  dc did a major shift in their movies  postponing a few of them and now  black adam doesn't even have a release  date so it's not looking insanely good  for movies releasing in theaters right  now at least anytime  soon so disney plus as premier access  may be the way to go and of course the  next thing that we hope to hear about  is the upcoming disney plus shows which  of course would include wanda vision the  falcon in the winter soldier the loki  series the hawkeye series  miss marvel she-hulk moon knight and for  the star wars fans the mandalorian and  possibly some kenobi news  now unfortunately i wouldn't expect a  new trailer or anything like that but  more along the lines of some production  updates and when they expect all of  these shows to actually launch  fortunately for us these disney plus  shows don't get delayed by theaters not  being open they get delayed by  production being postponed but it seems  like marvel studios and disney are  running full speed again  so hopefully we might get some sort of a  release schedule  and unfortunately we don't have to wait  that much longer for this quarter four  earnings report as it is scheduled for  november 12th of 2020  at 4 30 pm eastern time and 1 30 p.m  pacific standard time and then we have  some pretty crazy news about  the hawkeye series we have nine  different new  casting calls for the series and we  actually have the descriptions for the  characters as well that's listed on the  casting call and this is coming from  thedirect.com  and we'll just go through the different  characters the first casting call is for  a 20s to 40s male or female eastern  european  henchman speaks with an accent strong  supporting  reoccurring character and that character  has the code name of  misha the next character is going to be  a child character with the second  listing  titled bella the description reads  female  white 8 years old precautious daring and  confident with a sense of humor  the next casting call is for a character  called brady with the description of  male white nine years old energetic and  sweet  the next character is heather and the  description reads female  white midwestern 26 years old  smart and scrappy does what she needs to  in order to survive  the fifth casting is for a character  called rose and her description is quite  interesting and it reads  female 8 years old deaf indigenous  independent athletic and bright small  supporting  please note that the dialogue in the  edition scene can be spoken in english  or  signed in american sign language if the  actor knows that language  the next character is titled richard and  is a 40 to 50 year old male  indigenous american a loving father and  fierce protector the seventh casting  call is for a person named mary and the  description is female  late 30s to early 40s open ethnicity  highly professional and ambitious career  woman  no nonsense and a reoccurring character  the eighth casting call is pretty  interesting as it's named  detective sherman who will have a rio  crane role in the series the description  is 40s male open ethnicity new york city  detective  reoccurring character and the ninth one  is called  alex and it's described as a female or  male  30 to 50 years old a sincere but funny  oddball with an obsession  for the fantasy sci-fi genre  so the hawkeye disney plus series is  right now casting for  a bunch of different people now based  off of some of these descriptions we can  kind of guess  on what some of these characters are  going to be in the series and some of  them are pretty vague  misha seems to be a member of the  tracksuit mafia which has been rumored  for a very long time now to be appearing  in the hawkeye series  heather bella and brady are all kind of  similar they're relative in age and  in terms of race indicating that they  are probably part of the same family one  that might be close to hawkeye in the  series  and then there's rose who is going to be  a deaf character in the series which  means that she'll probably have some  sort of a connection to  ekko ekko is another deaf superhero who  has been confirmed to be appearing in  the series  and then there are some indigenous  characters which could be a connection  to  the occupy avengers this is a group that  hawkeye formed with other native  american heroes such as  red wolf and nightshade and with the  indigenous character description we  could be seeing this group in the  hawkeye series  now unfortunately murphy's  multiverse.com today did state that the  hawkeye series production has been  delayed but the fortunate news is it's  only been delayed a month  it was originally planned for october  but now it's set for november so this  most likely isn't due to kovid it's most  likely due to something else within the  studio which is good news  that means we really shouldn't see any  further delays with the hawkeye series  especially with everything else starting  back up  and that leads us to our final piece of  news which is about the falcon and the  winter soldier  the falcon and the winter soldier crew  has now returned to prague to finish  their filming and this comes from the  facebook page of  fendimefilmu who says that they have  spotted the stunt teams on the set  so falcon in the winter soldier is back  filming in prague but unfortunately we  still aren't going to get this series  until 2021  so a lot happening with marvel studios  right now which is a really really good  thing  kovid isn't slowing them down anymore  and hopefully we won't really get any  more changes to marvel's phase 4  schedule and again that's the great  thing with all of these disney plus  shows kovid really doesn't affect the  release of them it only affects the  production  but right now everything is in  production or starting production  very soon so lots of marvel content  coming very  very soon so let me know how excited you  are for this in the comments down below  and let me know which disney plus series  you're excited for the most  don't forget to like the video and  subscribe so you don't miss out on any  of the latest mcu news for live  updates you can follow me on twitter and  instagram and as always thank you all so  much for watching  woof

